@startuml sequence_empty_day
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Empty Day

participant ReviewGoalHistoryController as Ctrl
participant GoalProgressService as Svc
participant "Commitments.Api" as Api
participant ReviewGoalHistoryTileComponent as Comp

Ctrl -> Svc: getAt(goalId, asOf)
Svc -> Api: GET /at
Api --> Svc: { count: 0, target: 30, asOf }
Svc --> Ctrl: historical
Ctrl -> Comp: render '0 / 30' + 'No achievements that day'

note right of Comp
  Same height. No collapse,\nno spinner replacement.
end note

@enduml
